### discovery
GET http://localhost:9000/.well-known/openid-configuration

### jwks
GET http://localhost:9000/oauth2/jwks

### 1. authorization_code + PKCE 없이: 브라우저에서 아래 URL 접속 (user/password 로그인 -> consent)
# http://localhost:9000/oauth2/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=oidc-client&scope=openid%20profile%20email%20read&redirect_uri=http://127.0.0.1:9000/authorized&state=xyz

### 2. code -> token
POST http://localhost:9000/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic oidc-client oidc-secret
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&code={{code}}&redirect_uri=http://127.0.0.1:9000/authorized

### 3. userinfo (OIDC)
GET http://localhost:9000/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. resource server
GET http://localhost:9000/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. resource server - read scope 필요
GET http://localhost:9000/api/scoped/resource
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### refresh_token
POST http://localhost:9000/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic oidc-client oidc-secret
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token={{refreshToken}}

### client_credentials (machine to machine)
POST http://localhost:9000/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic service-client service-secret
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&scope=read

### token introspection
POST http://localhost:9000/oauth2/introspect
Authorization: Basic service-client service-secret
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token={{accessToken}}
